{"schemaVersion":1,"corpusId":"euclid-elements-heath-1908","status":"raw_machine","contentItem":{"id":"euclid-10-52","kind":"proposition","title":"构造与求解：二项无理线段与线段","englishTitle":"To find the fifth binomial straight line.","book":10,"number":52,"status":"raw_machine","sourceMissing":false,"source":{"urn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_2.52","url":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_2.52/","group":"prop_2","sourceNumber":52,"corpusSha256":"ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c","hasSourceFigure":true,"historicalChineseUrl":null}},"revision":{"id":"euclid-10-52@raw-6bc54ec69c7f1332","contentId":"euclid-10-52","version":1,"status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"6bc54ec69c7f13327c39fddd5c725d9ebe4a6cc254f1c3e4f208f9f2dc35d948","createdBy":"mathforge-corpus-import","changeSummary":"Imported Heath source and machine-assisted Chinese draft. No mathematical or editorial review is implied.","blockIds":["euclid-10-52.statement","euclid-10-52.construction.1","euclid-10-52.construction.2","euclid-10-52.proof.1","euclid-10-52.proof.2","euclid-10-52.proof.3","euclid-10-52.proof.4","euclid-10-52.construction.3","euclid-10-52.proof.5","euclid-10-52.proof.6","euclid-10-52.proof.7","euclid-10-52.conclusion","euclid-10-52.source"]},"blocks":[{"id":"euclid-10-52.statement","contentId":"euclid-10-52","revisionId":"euclid-10-52@raw-6bc54ec69c7f1332","order":0,"kind":"statement","title":"命题陈述","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"32c30ffc21588400a6d17fca1049214e4c15df13863889be5799bdb8d20de99b","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"To find the fifth binomial straight line."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"找到第五条二项无理线段直线"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-52.construction.1","contentId":"euclid-10-52","revisionId":"euclid-10-52@raw-6bc54ec69c7f1332","order":1,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"b90b3b5615df41ae706a5e26924afe55e5c5b84c00a72869d0d732361d19199d","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let two numbers AC, CB be set out such that AB has not to either of them the ratio which a square number has to a square number; let any rational straight line D be set out, and let EF be commensurable with D; therefore EF is rational."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"列出两个数字AC,CB,AB与两者中任何一个没有平方数与平方数的比;列出任何有理线段,D与EF的比例,EF与D的比例,EF与D的比例,EF与有理的比例；上述对应量可公度。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-52.construction.2","contentId":"euclid-10-52","revisionId":"euclid-10-52@raw-6bc54ec69c7f1332","order":2,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"0b6b9131aa6164422e80622a3fa8bbb7ae4738bab7f553b0e10c210ef7837fd2","citations":["euclid-10-6"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let it be contrived that, as CA is to AB, so is the square on EF to the square on FG. [[X. 6, Por.](/principles/euclid-10-6)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"假设CA比AB等于EF比正方形比FG [[X. 6, Por.](/principles/euclid-10-6)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-52.proof.1","contentId":"euclid-10-52","revisionId":"euclid-10-52@raw-6bc54ec69c7f1332","order":3,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"80bfa5c6305d09a2c1736786e6e2e53d893844e82bc93fafd2df380a59e9fc6c","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But CA has not to AB the ratio which a square number has to a square number; therefore neither has the square on EF to the square on FG the ratio which a square number has to a square number."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但CA的比例没有达到平方数的比例,达到平方数的比例,达到平方数的比例;因此,EF的比例为正方形,而FG的比例为正方形,达到平方数的比例为平方数。（相关点与线段：AB）"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-52.proof.2","contentId":"euclid-10-52","revisionId":"euclid-10-52@raw-6bc54ec69c7f1332","order":4,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"b79cbedf6947410df22799b36c73109b304a09a31ada148a8c4b5a36ebdfbd85","citations":["euclid-10-9","euclid-10-36"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore EF, FG are rational straight lines commensurable in square only; [[X. 9](/principles/euclid-10-9)] therefore EG is binomial. [[X. 36](/principles/euclid-10-36)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,EF,FG是有理线段,平方可公度而长度不可公度;EG是二项无理线段。 [[X. 9](/principles/euclid-10-9)] [[X. 36](/principles/euclid-10-36)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-52.proof.3","contentId":"euclid-10-52","revisionId":"euclid-10-52@raw-6bc54ec69c7f1332","order":5,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"63c7eb729f299f1e0929a9843a59bd56df19fa76f19e4e43a41e72e4dd11c7b1","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"I say next that it is also a fifth binomial straight line."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"我接下来说,这也是第五条二项无理线段直线。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-52.proof.4","contentId":"euclid-10-52","revisionId":"euclid-10-52@raw-6bc54ec69c7f1332","order":6,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 4","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"68a3eca1b73e84517775f35322eef19b2480e2f764f36f2e851e2746c38ba3f5","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For since, as CA is to AB, so is the square on EF to the square on FG, inversely, as BA is to AC, so is the square on FG to the square on FE; therefore the square on GF is greater than the square on FE."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"CA比AB等于EF比正方形,FG比正方形,BA比AC等于CA比正方形,FE比正方形,FE比正方形,GF比正方形"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-52.construction.3","contentId":"euclid-10-52","revisionId":"euclid-10-52@raw-6bc54ec69c7f1332","order":7,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"e354fc820ef0505204746eb3248e8d28a7b59c58817c11720b4a403a4875fb88","citations":["euclid-5-19"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let then the squares on EF, H be equal to the square on GF; therefore, convertendo, as the number AB is to BC, so is the square on GF to the square on H. [[V. 19, Por.](/principles/euclid-5-19)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"EF,H,正方形等于GF,正方形;因此,转换后,AB-BC的比等于GF,正方形对正方形的比。 [[V. 19, Por.](/principles/euclid-5-19)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-52.proof.5","contentId":"euclid-10-52","revisionId":"euclid-10-52@raw-6bc54ec69c7f1332","order":8,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 5","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"befee2260727be615b1f3172d845639de364c7f3f0c80efbba05faf25b7b617d","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But AB has not to BC the ratio which a square number has to a square number; therefore neither has the square on FG to the square on H the ratio which a square number has to a square number."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但AB的比例没有达到平方数的比例,达到平方数的比例,达到平方数的比例;因此,FG的比例为正方形,而H的比例为正方形,达到平方数的比例为平方数。（相关点与线段：BC）"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-52.proof.6","contentId":"euclid-10-52","revisionId":"euclid-10-52@raw-6bc54ec69c7f1332","order":9,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 6","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"47f62945ebc288164391db57a6dda725fd4f212baa717b85552c4ba8d39683b0","citations":["euclid-10-9"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore FG is incommensurable in length with H; [[X. 9](/principles/euclid-10-9)] so that the square on FG is greater than the square on FE by the square on a straight line incommensurable with FG."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,FG的长度为不可公度,H的长度为FG;因此,FG的正方形比FE的正方形长,比不可公度的直线不可公度和FG的正方形长。 [[X. 9](/principles/euclid-10-9)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-52.proof.7","contentId":"euclid-10-52","revisionId":"euclid-10-52@raw-6bc54ec69c7f1332","order":10,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 7","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"8e67e6c7084c5a8766ffbcd3a0d96612e4708432b0d27f222e44a32024026751","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And GF, FE are rational straight lines commensurable in square only, and the lesser term EF is commensurable in length with the rational straight line D set out."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"GF,FE是有理线段 平方可公度而长度不可公度, 较轻的EF是长度可公度, 并设置了有理线段 D。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-52.conclusion","contentId":"euclid-10-52","revisionId":"euclid-10-52@raw-6bc54ec69c7f1332","order":11,"kind":"conclusion","title":"结论","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"83749a3c12f388d5af6436daf5505bc5048424871c3abcd226d7647fc7f54720","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore EG is a fifth binomial straight line. Q. E. D."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,EG是第五条二项无理线段直线,证毕。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-52.source","contentId":"euclid-10-52","revisionId":"euclid-10-52@raw-6bc54ec69c7f1332","order":12,"kind":"source","title":"来源、译者与开放许可","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"a6b354f96a28b2e192e57f98fd86b5c37233a2a9a86a05712645eafe007da361","cit